title: The TULIP Trap: Rejecting Calvinist and Arminian Premises
description: Beyond TULIP: the whole TULIP debate rests on faulty premises Scripture does not require us to accept; the Bible presents a straightforward gospel of grace through faith alone.
output: lessons/heresies/tulip-trap.html

